{"name": "Mini Tank Mayhem", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras_big/b01e0936fca75c19676395f1e2edd24a.avif?t=1784252162\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/b01e0936fca75c19676395f1e2edd24a.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/a55bab4adffef876b28455cc55069898.poster.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/a55bab4adffef876b28455cc55069898.webm?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/a55bab4adffef876b28455cc55069898.mp4?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The alien hordes have arrived, and only your mini-tank and your one-of-a-kind deck stand in their way. Mini Tank Mayhem is a unique blend of deckbuilding, tower defense, and roguelike elements, where strategic maneuvers meet tower defense chaos. Shape your deck from hundreds of available cards, acquire powerful artifacts, and upgrade your mini-tank to get rid of the aliens once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras_big/e8c7ec4ddcab90db248563b51d0a7151.avif?t=1784252162\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/e8c7ec4ddcab90db248563b51d0a7151.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/667cf1869fa03b1aee24ba8585f13365.poster.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/667cf1869fa03b1aee24ba8585f13365.webm?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/667cf1869fa03b1aee24ba8585f13365.mp4?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With roguelike progression at its core, each battle increases your most valuable resource \u2013 knowledge. Tweak your deck on the fly, adapt to enemy patterns, and discover powerful synergies as you fight to protect the Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/382f47062963795f752137e512325343.poster.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/382f47062963795f752137e512325343.webm?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/382f47062963795f752137e512325343.mp4?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras_big/102c424477ab45ce0e10ba683d5835a5.avif?t=1784252162\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/102c424477ab45ce0e10ba683d5835a5.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/b4838b4f59768cfd6f2b9875385f39a5.poster.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/b4838b4f59768cfd6f2b9875385f39a5.webm?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/b4838b4f59768cfd6f2b9875385f39a5.mp4?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick from a roster of unique commanders, each bringing a different playstyle and starting deck to the battlefield. Wanna focus on the pure strength of your tank? Or maybe you want to play tricks on your opponents and focus more on the poison build? No matter what your preferred playstyle is, in Mini Tank Mayhem you will always find your cup of tea.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/5e0e8cb87f6b04b0fa0801c496f4dc7e.poster.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/5e0e8cb87f6b04b0fa0801c496f4dc7e.webm?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/5e0e8cb87f6b04b0fa0801c496f4dc7e.mp4?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras_big/268a31168693ac3f728837047394c60e.avif?t=1784252162\" height=\"194\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/268a31168693ac3f728837047394c60e.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini Tank Mayhem offers endless possibilities to break the game or, essentially, survive one more wave. And that is where the true fun and mayhem begin. Combine hundreds of cards and artifacts to create game-breaking power to eventually obliterate your enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/a493223fa20ab45cd565575c25134e8c.poster.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/a493223fa20ab45cd565575c25134e8c.webm?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/a493223fa20ab45cd565575c25134e8c.mp4?t=1784252162\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras_big/e15c36f9230e1c63198a4fde2f0f35ec.avif?t=1784252162\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/extras/e15c36f9230e1c63198a4fde2f0f35ec.avif?t=1784252162\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical deckbuilding meets  tower defense with roguelike progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique commanders with different starting decks and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of different cards and artifacts to discover and combine to annihilate your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep replay value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High replayability and never-ending combos to uncover</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Mini Tank Mayhem is a roguelike deck-building tower defense game where you command a powerful mini-tank to repel waves of alien invaders. Craft your very own deck, deploy strategic defenses, and unleash devastating combos to protect Earth from pesky aliens!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2096260/9623087d41b4900569a7e0d00a0b266fc2efa563/header.jpg?t=1784252162", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Deckbuilding", "Card Game", "Tower Defense", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Wargame"], "developers": "Algorocks", "publishers": "Algorocks", "release_date": "Apr 29, 2026", "price": "$11.99", "appid": "2096260", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "7 June 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/eO2dGDGhQbo", "first_seen": 1749254400.0, "review_rank": 1596}